          "highlight": [
            "reportedly"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "幾位閣員據傳曾為該稅法修正案遊說。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "By reportedly pressuring suppliers, the giant drew an antitrust inquiry.",
          "highlight": [
            "reportedly"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "由於據傳對供應商施壓，該巨頭引發反托拉斯調查。"
          }
